title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources available: [+ resources +]

PPS position: [? if spd_toleration : toleration ?][? if spd_in_government : in government - ?][? if spd_toleration == 0 and spd_in_government == 0 and spd_caretaker == 0 : opposition ?][? if spd_caretaker : caretaker government ?]
[? if in_polish_left_coalition and spd_in_government: Koalicja Lewicy ?][? if in_polish_center_left_coalition and spd_in_government: koalicja centrolewicowa ?][? if in_spd_majority and spd_in_government: PPS majority ?][? if in_minority_government and spd_in_government: minority government [? if minorities_toleration: with Minorities Bloc toleration ?] ?][? if in_chjeno_piast: opposition to Chjeno-Piast ?]

[? if spd_in_government and not in_spd_majority and not in_left_front : Coalition dissent: [+ coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

[? if spd_in_government and (in_left_front or in_popular_front): KPD coalition dissent: [+ kpd_coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

= Government

President: [+ president +]

Chancellor: [+ chancellor +] ([+ chancellor_party +])

Sejm composition (gameplay percentages):

KPP: [+ kpp_r +]%

PPS: [+ pps_r +]%

NPR: [+ npr_r +]%

PSL Wyzwolenie: [+ psl_wyzwolenie_r +]%

PSL Piast: [+ psl_piast_r +]%

PSChD: [+ pschd_r +]%

[+ zln_name +]: [+ zln_r +]%

Blok Mniejszości Narodowych: [+ minorities_bloc_r +]%

Inne: [+ other_r +]%

[? if spd_in_government = 1 : Budget: [+ budget +] ?]

Next election: [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]

= Economics

Inflation: [+ inflation_2 +]%

[? if black_thursday_seen = 1 : Unemployment: [+ unemployed_2 +]% ?]

Economic growth: [+ economic_growth_2 +]%



